<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daeyu to issue $18 mln bonds overseas.</title>
<headline>Daeyu to issue $18 mln bonds overseas.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Daeyu Co Ltd will issue $18 million worth of convertible bonds in Europe next month, a company statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The synthetic yarns maker planned to use proceeds from the sales of the bonds to help finance its overseas investment.</p>
<p>South Korea's Ssangyong Securities is a lead-manager of the issue, the statement said.</p>
<p>The bonds will be listed on the Luxembourg bourse.</p>
<p>No further details were given.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
